# Pencil Design — Single source of truth

## Rule (always apply)

All Cosmos UI/UX design lives in **one** file:

**`UIX/pencil-new.pen`**

Do **not** create separate per-module `.pen` files under `UIX/` unless the user explicitly asks to split again.

## What the monolith contains

Organize screens as **top-level frames** (artboards) with `name` including the canonical route:

| Area | Frame name prefix | Live reference |
|------|-------------------|----------------|
| Store OS / POS | `Store OS`, `Step 0`, `Order Creation`, `00 Tablet`, etc. | `POS_Prototype.html`, `docs/ui/store-os.md` |
| Store Pilot | `SP —` | `StorePilot_Prototype.html` |
| Foundry | `FY —`, Foundry desktop/mobile | `Foundry_Prototype.html` |
| Command Unit | `CU —` | `CommandUnit_Prototype.html`, `docs/ui/command-unit-promotions.md` |
| Army HR (Careers) | `AR Mobile —` | `src/public/army-careers.html`, `docs/ui/army-careers.md` |

**Army HR frames (required):**

- `AR Mobile — Careers Home · /army/careers`
- `AR Mobile — Job Detail · /army/careers/:slug`
- `AR Mobile — Apply Form · /army/careers/:slug/apply`
- `AR Mobile — Application Status · /army/careers/status`

Place new module artboards in **empty canvas space** (e.g. Army cluster ~x=14000) so frames do not overlap.

## Workflow

1. Open **`UIX/pencil-new.pen`** in **Pencil Design Editor** (required for MCP).
2. Use Pencil MCP only (`batch_get`, `batch_design`, `get_screenshot`) — never Read/Write `.pen` as text.
3. Follow **`ui-ux-pen-first-workflow.mdc`**, **`pencil-mcp-no-notes.mdc`**, **`pencil-pos-url-mapping.mdc`** (Store OS routes on frame names).
4. Optional mirror copy: after a session, sync to `src/public/design/pencil-local/pencil-new.pen` **only if** the team still serves that path — **authoritative file is `UIX/pencil-new.pen`**.

## Deprecated paths

- Per-module `UIX/Store-OS.pen`, `UIX/Army-HR.pen`, etc. — **removed**; do not recreate.
- Root `pencil-new.pen` — do not use for new work.

## Exceptions

- User explicitly requests a **split** into module files again → discuss layout, then update this rule.
